; ============================================
; Acceleration Limit Test - Klipper Compatible
; Bed: 350x350, Center: 175,175
; Speed: fixed 200mm/s
; Accel: 3000 -> 10000 mm/s^2, starting from known-good
; Short moves (50mm): acceleration-dominated, max stress per reversal
; Medium moves (200mm): square corners and star
; No filament needed - motion test only
; ============================================
; Watch TFT notification pop-ups to know which level fails.
; Stop if you hear a skip or thud -- that level is your limit.
; ============================================
; Short move coords (50mm span, centered):
;   X: 150 <-> 200   Y: 150 <-> 200   Diag: (150,150)<->(200,200)
; Medium move coords (200mm span):
;   X: 75 <-> 275    Y: 75 <-> 275
; ============================================

G28
G90
G1 Z5 F300
G1 X175 Y175 F6000
TFT_NOTIFY MSG="Accel Test Starting"

; ============================================
; 3000 mm/s^2 -- known good baseline
; ============================================
SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=3000 VELOCITY=200
TFT_NOTIFY MSG="ACCEL 3000 - X oscillation"
G1 X150 Y175 F12000
G1 X200 Y175 F12000
G1 X150 Y175 F12000
G1 X200 Y175 F12000
G1 X150 Y175 F12000
G1 X200 Y175 F12000
G1 X150 Y175 F12000
G1 X200 Y175 F12000
G1 X175 Y175 F12000

